== One-Sentence Summary

A complete state of the art review of numerical analyses of specifically punching shear force.

== Research Question / Objective

Punching shear is a critical failure mode that has the potential to cause complete failure of the structure. It is also an extremely complex system, that can be studied via numerical analyes. 

Numerical analyses on the topic have grown substantially along the years, proportionally to the study of the punching shear force itself. 

Until then, no other study focused on a s comprehencive and focused review of numerical analyses on punching shear.

